  "PackageSlug": "go/github.com/falcosecurity/plugins/plugins/k8saudit-aks",
  "Title": "k8saudit shipped rules do not detect privileged/sensitive settings on init or ephemeral containers",
  "Description": "The `k8saudit` plugin's per-container fields (`ka.req.pod.containers.*`) and the shipped `k8s_audit_rules.yaml` evaluated only `requestObject.spec.containers`. Security-relevant settings on a pod's `initContainers` or `ephemeralContainers` were not inspected, so the shipped `Create Privileged Pod` rule did not fire for a privileged container placed in either list.",
  "Date": "2026-09-21",
